<section class="card"><h2>Connection behavior</h2><p>LifeOS sends requests only when you connect, refresh or submit an action. Website management is an optional online feature. Your personal LifeOS modules continue to use local data.</p><p>Tokens and fetched records are encrypted for the current app session. Restarting or locking LifeOS clears access. HTTPS endpoints, certificate verification and version checks are required.</p></section>
